# Islas Escarcha, floor 2 (C7, contract 53), 22 x 20, a cave. THE BOULDER PUZZLE (simplified: the current of lowest floor dies when the holes above are plugged): two PITS (flags 855 / 856 = `esc_pit_a` / `esc_pit_b`) and
# three boulders; the first boulder (6,6) rolls straight down column 6 into the pit (6,12) (6 pushes), the second (10,6) needs 3 pushes east to column 13 and then 6 south into the pit (13,12), the third (9,10) is a decoy. Pushing needs Empuje (module 91) and the Medalla Raiz.
# The Tide Gem (Barnaclad's evolution) in the north-east corner, a Rich Salve, a note (sign). The ladder (4,4) goes up, the ladder (17,15) down.
@map islas_escarcha_2
@size 22 20
@interior no
@cave yes
@area islas_escarcha
@bg 0
@surf yes
@flag esc_pit_a 855     # the first pit is plugged (the first rapids of floor 3 dissolve)
@flag esc_pit_b 856     # the second pit is plugged
@encounters grass rate=14
  echowing 40 44 25
  echolet 40 44 5
  belubub 38 42 25
  plattypuzz 38 42 20
  lazatee 38 41 15
  barnacub 38 42 10
@end
# Roaming wild creatures (contract 55, rollout in 63): 2 creatures of this table wander the whole walkable floor (grass included); touching one starts that wild battle.
@roam 2 table=grass area=abcde period=1800
@spawn up 4 5 S
@spawn down 17 14 N
@legend
  .  tile=none
  a  tile=ice_10
  b  tile=ice_01
  c  tile=ice_11
  d  tile=ice_00
  e  tile=frost_tuft
  f  tile=none object=snow_drift
  g  tile=none object=cwall
  h  tile=ice_00 object=ice_pillar
  i  tile=ice_11 object=snow_drift
  j  tile=ice_01 object=snow_drift
  k  tile=ice_10 object=snow_drift
  l  tile=ice_00 boulder=yes
  m  tile=ice_11 object=ice_pillar
  n  tile=frost_tuft item=agua
  o  tile=ice_00 door=rope_ladder
  p  tile=ice_01 object=sign interact=look text=esc2.sign
  q  tile=ice_10 boulder=yes
  r  tile=ice_00 hole=esc_pit_a
  s  tile=ice_10 hole=esc_pit_b
  t  tile=ice_11 door=rope_ladder
  u  tile=ice_11 item=rich_salve
  v  tile=ice_01 item=pp_extra   # contract 77: PP Extra, found only
  H  tile=ice_01 hidden=vigor_flask   # hidden (contract 80, hidden items)
@grid
  ......................
